---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="T-Time Series — T-Time Media"
  description="T-Time Series is about transgender men and transmasculine people — our lives and our history, told by the people living it."
  ogPath="/series"
>
  <Header />

  <!-- ================= SERIES ================= -->
  <section id="about">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Flagship series</h2>
      <p class="page-title">T-Time Series</p>
      <p class="lede">Trans men's stories, told by the people living them.</p>
      <div class="doc">
        <p>T-Time Series is about transgender men and transmasculine people — our lives and our history. That includes men who've medically transitioned and men who haven't, men who "pass" and men who don't, binary and nonbinary transmasculine people alike. T-Time Series isn't defining who counts.</p>
        <p>It runs on other people's stories, not just Dominic's — portraits, interviews, and stories told in people's own words.</p>

        <div class="figure">
          <span class="big">"I started T-Time because trans men's stories were missing — from mainstream LGBTQ+ conversations, media coverage, even our own community spaces. I wanted to put us at the center: to document our history, amplify our voices, and create a place where trans men can finally see themselves reflected."</span>
          <cite>— Dominic, on why he started T-Time Series</cite>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-accent" href="/be-in-it">Be in it →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
